## Hello World

```
"Hello World!" INSPECT
```

## Hello User

```
"Hello " DRAFT TIE INSPECT
```

## Reverse

```
DRAFT REVERSE INSPECT
```

## Palindrome

```
DRAFT DOUBLE REVERSE DYE INSPECT
```

## Print Input

```
DRAFT DRAFT CROSS INSPECT INSPECT
```

## Reverse Halves

```
DRAFT SEVER CROSS TIE INSPECT
```

## Secret Note

```
DRAFT "13" SHIFT INSPECT
```
